1: /* SINGLE CYLINDER — physically based 4-stroke engine model.
2:  * Slider-crank kinematics, single-zone cylinder gas, orifice valve flow,
3:  * plenum manifold, Wiebe heat release, Woschni-style wall loss and a
4:  * Livengood-Wu style knock tendency. SI units throughout, degrees at the UI.
5:  */
